    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d785">

                <pb facs="0878" n="786" xml:id="pg786"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.7311/3</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Sharp</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-08T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 8, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2702. Your despatch 5622, August 22.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d785-f1"/> Inform Mr.
                        Popovitch Government of United States has learned of
                    proposed establishment by Montenegrin Government of legation at Washington and
                    will be happy to receive an accredited minister from that Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
